==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Clawitzer|75}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Aqua Shower''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Prinplup|58}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

